msgid ""
"\\textit{Colonization of the unseen lands went well, until your scouts brought news of unknown horse trails by the nearby lake.\n"
"You are not the only one looking for the Mystical Foreland.\n"
"Double the nightguard and move out at dawn.}  % no-check-caps\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

